      "spam": false,
      "value": "Hmm, how about just types of voice-chat, we can switch to \"Normal\" or \"Whispering\" and it would be indicated on our UI/GUI/HUD, and whispering would make our voice-reach radius significantly smaller compared to normal voice. This would avoid the \"Invites\" system and it's pretty straight forward when you don't want someone to listen to what you're saying and while you whisper you can just tell the other person you're doing it to that you're whispering so they know it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
