      "value": "@{59c0656870ccdf4ea7aeef22|full_name}: The point of \"whispering\" is to have secure 1-on-1 conversations with no possible chance of eavesdropping.\nJust lowering your range your voice is broadcast would still let people eavesdrop on you if you're not looking over your shoulder all the time.",
