      "value": "@{58c6b8f8227a56787575ebc0|full_name}: I see, I just dislike that it might make many users drift off into too many 'private' conversations, also some would probably want a bigger group for whispering between each other too and I just feel it would look strange and somewhat bad. Also imagine someone approaches a 1on1 private convo, and asks something and you want to answer anyways and keep the whisper convo going, switching between both or having to stop that whisper convo and go back into it and so forth..",
