      "value": "@{59c0656870ccdf4ea7aeef22|full_name}: Like I wrote before, not more than 2 people in total would be able to whisper with each other; therefore people wouldn't be able to be in a group and whisper with each other. They would have to create a private instance to talk privately.\nAs for things being awkward when someone interrupts two people whispering, that's a non-issue imo. That person will just have to wait until those two are done talking in private.",
