  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2017-09-06T01:23:15.523Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Be able to start \"whispering\" with one other player. You would send a request to another user, if they accept everyone else will become muted/have their voices lowered and the only person who can hear you is the other user who are \"whispering\" with you.\nThere wouldn't be able to be more than 2 users in total whispering with each other to discourage groups of people talking only with themselves in a crowd, they can move to another place if needed.\nWhen a user is \"whispering\" their speech bubble icon would be swapped out to a looping \"dot dot dot...\" speech bubble, so it's atleast a little discreet if you need to have a quick word with someone during a event.",
